DSN SYSTEM(DB2P)
BIND PACKAGE(ACCTCOLL) MEMBER(ACCTPOST) OWNER(ACCTOWN) -
     QUALIFIER(ACCTQUAL) ACTION(REPLACE) ISOLATION(CS)
BIND PACKAGE(ACCTCOLL) MEMBER(ACCTINQ) OWNER(ACCTOWN) -
     QUALIFIER(ACCTQUAL) ACTION(REPLACE)
BIND PLAN(ACCTPLN) PKLIST(ACCTCOLL.*) OWNER(ACCTOWN) -
     ACTION(REPLACE) RETAIN
END
